[00:30.80]Last night I realized
[00:41.05]Waking from a dream
[00:45.65]That all of my dear conscious mind
[00:54.10]Is composed of energy
[01:46.34]Now I do see, I've always been
[01:50.78]One with everything
[01:54.65]And now I feel deep in my eyes
[02:04.60]The cosmos is alive
[02:14.49]In every cell that threads my being
[02:24.02]The universe breathes
[02:29.29]In every thought and melody
[02:37.42]The stars have always been
[02:51.74]I'm one with everything
